 "origem": "autoral (método 'cut and cover': Linha 1 de Budapeste 1896, metrô de Paris 1900, IRT de Nova York 1904) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cut-and-cover",
 "titulo": "You built a subway under the street 🚇 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A SUBWAY",
 "descripcion": "From a jammed avenue to a trench with concrete walls, steel struts and a roof that puts the street back on top. That's cut and cover, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #subway #metro #howitworks #shorts",
 "tags": [
